Package: wb-telegram
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Telegram bot for Wiren Board controllers
 wb-telegram publishes Telegram bot commands to MQTT controls of the
 telegram_bot device and delivers messages written by wb-rules to the
 send control. Settings are edited in the Wiren Board web interface.
